    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.poster.avif?t=1748457097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.webm?t=1748457097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.mp4?t=1748457097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Generate avatars for Steam and your games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use your own photo or generate avatars from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Animate them within seconds to create your own vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use them freely across Steam and your games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test your gamer skill and get your GameQ score</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Test your reaction speed, memory and strategic thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compare yourself against players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your skills to boost performance in your favorite games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get live AI assistance while you game</strong></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can comment on your strategy/approach and gameplay while you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will answer any question you have about any game you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can guide you through any challenge, mission or quest.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.poster.avif?t=1748457097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.webm?t=1748457097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612370/extras/553af7860cff6e5d9f5047c4ba7f1746.mp4?t=1748457097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Generate avatars for Steam and your games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use your own photo or generate avatars from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Animate them within seconds to create your own vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use them freely across Steam and your games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test your gamer skill and get your GameQ score</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Test your reaction speed, memory and strategic thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compare yourself against players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your skills to boost performance in your favorite games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get live AI assistance while you game</strong></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can comment on your strategy/approach and gameplay while you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will answer any question you have about any game you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can guide you through any challenge, mission or quest.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Test your gamer skill and generate cool avatars that you can immediately use in your gaming profiles and games!",
